            "review_title": "Review at La Hostaria",
            "review_text": "Nik L\nNew York City, New York30 contributions\n0\nNice little Italian spot in Saigon\nFeb 2020 • Solo\nI've been here in Saigon for a few months and while I love the Vietnamese food here, I need something different once in a while. La Hosteria is a perfect little spot near Ben Thanh Market serving fantastic Italian food, which perfectly fills my cravings. It's my second time here and I couldn't be happier, sitting at their only outdoor table with tiger beer and spaghetti carbonara. I'm surprised that this restaurant has such few visitors - it's one of the nicer spots I've been to around here, and the food is delicious.\nRead more\nWritten February 29, 2020",
